public sealed class UtilityHack{public bool HexN{get;set;}public int TurnN{get;set;}public int RepairTurnsN{get;set;}public int ShieldTurnsN{get;set;}public int VectorTurnsN{get;set;}public int VectorNodeN{get;set;}=-1;public string Target{get;set;}="";public int Slot{get;set;}public int Coherence{get;set;}public int MaxCoherence{get;set;}public int Strength{get;set;}public int UtilitySlots{get;set;}public bool Complete{get;set;}public bool Won{get;set;}public int Shield{get;set;}public List<string> Tools{get;set;}=[];public HackNode[] Nodes{get;set;}=[];}
public sealed partial class DemoWorld
{
 public List<ScanProbe> ScanProbes=[];public List<UtilitySite> UtilitySites=[];public float ProbeScanLeft,ProbeRange=4;public Vector3 ProbeCenter;public string ProbeSelection="";public UtilityHack? UtilityHackState;
 void EnsureUtilitySites()=>EnsureProbeCatalog();
 void DeployUtilityProbes(UtilityState state)=>DeployProbeFormation(state);
 void EnsureCombatScanSites()=>RefreshCombatProbeContacts();
 public bool AnalyzeUtilityProbes()=>BeginProbeAnalysis();
 public void CenterUtilityProbes(){var s=UtilitySites.FirstOrDefault(s=>s.Id==ProbeSelection&&s.System==SystemId);if(s!=null)MoveProbeFormation(new(s.EstimateX,s.EstimateY,s.EstimateZ));}
 public bool RecallUtilityProbes()=>RecoverActiveProbes();
 void UpdateUtilityProbes(float dt)=>TickProbeScanning(dt);
 public bool WarpUtilitySite(){var site=UtilitySites.FirstOrDefault(s=>s.Id==ProbeSelection&&s.System==SystemId&&ProbeWarpable(s));return site!=null&&BeginWarp(site.Id,site.TargetId.Length>0?3500:0);}
 void EnterResolvedUtilitySite(UtilitySite site,SpacePosition arrival){if(site.Id.StartsWith("f:")||site.Id.StartsWith("wf:")){if(site.Id.StartsWith("f:"))EnterEncounterF(site.Id);else EnterConnectionGridF(site.Id);SolarOrigin=new SpacePosition(site.X*SolarCatalog.AU,site.Y*SolarCatalog.AU,site.Z*SolarCatalog.AU);SolarCelestial=site.Id;SolarGridKey=SolarCatalog.GridKey(SystemId,SolarOrigin);Player.Position=(arrival-SolarOrigin).Local;return;}RememberSolarGrid();EnterGrid("utility_site",false);Targets.Clear();SolarOrigin=new SpacePosition(site.X*SolarCatalog.AU,site.Y*SolarCatalog.AU,site.Z*SolarCatalog.AU);SolarCelestial=site.Id;SolarGridKey=SolarCatalog.GridKey(SystemId,SolarOrigin);Player.Position=(arrival-SolarOrigin).Local;
 if(SolarGrids.TryGetValue(SolarGridKey,out var memory)){foreach(var t in CopyTargets(memory.Targets)){t.Position+=(memory.Origin-SolarOrigin).Local;Targets.Add(t);}}
 else if(site.Kind=="Wormhole"){if(!Wormholes.Any(h=>h.Id==site.Id))Wormholes.Add(new(){Id=site.Id,A=SystemId,B=Systems.First(s=>s.Id!=SystemId).Id,RemainingMass=2000000000,MaxShipMass=300000000});Targets.Add(new(){Id=site.Id,Name="Unstable spatial fracture",Kind=TargetKind.Wormhole,Position=new(2000,0,0)});}else if(site.Kind=="Combat"){for(int i=0;i<4;i++)Targets.Add(new(){Id=site.Id+"_guard_"+i,Name="Listening post guardian",Kind=TargetKind.Raider,Profile=Ship.RaiderProfile(),Position=new(5000+i*1000,0,i*400),Shield=120,Armor=100,Hull=100});}else if(site.Kind=="Ore"){for(int i=0;i<9;i++)Targets.Add(new(){Id=site.Id+"_ore_"+i,Name="Hidden Riftstone asteroid",Kind=TargetKind.Asteroid,Resource="deepore",Ore=site.Remaining/9,Position=new(1500+i*300,0,i*400)});}else if(site.Kind=="Gas")Targets.Add(new(){Id=site.Id,Name="Resolved vapor cloud",Kind=TargetKind.Asteroid,Resource="gas",Position=new(1100,0,0),Ore=site.Remaining});else if(site.Kind=="Ship")Targets.Add(new(){Id=site.Id,Name="Survey patrol",Kind=TargetKind.Raider,Training=true,Position=new(3000,0,0),Profile=new Ship()});else Targets.Add(new(){Id=site.Id,Name=site.Kind+" archive",Kind=TargetKind.Container,SiteKind=site.Kind,Position=new(1400,0,0),Hacked=site.Completed,HackAttempts=site.Attempts,Destroyed=site.Attempts>=2&&!site.Completed,Contents=new(){{"salvage",30},{"ut_coolant",25}}});RestoreWingmates();RestoreDroneGrid();}
 void StartUtilityHack(UtilityState s){var d=s.Definition!;var t=Locked!;var nodes=Enumerable.Range(0,49).Select(_=>new HackNode()).ToArray();for(int i=1;i<49;i++){double roll=_rng.NextDouble();var n=nodes[i];if(roll<.28){n.Kind=new[]{"Firewall","Antivirus","Restoration","Suppressor"}[_rng.Next(4)];n.Hp=n.Kind=="Firewall"?45:30;n.Strength=n.Kind=="Antivirus"?12:7;}else if(roll<.39)n.Kind="Cache";}nodes[0].Open=nodes[0].Cleared=true;nodes[48]=new(){Kind="Core",Hp=55,Strength=9};ConfigureHackF(t,nodes);UtilityHackState=new(){Target=t.Id,Slot=Array.IndexOf(Player.Utilities,s),Coherence=d.VirusCoherence+Player.RigCoherence(t.SiteKind),MaxCoherence=d.VirusCoherence+Player.RigCoherence(t.SiteKind),Strength=d.VirusStrength+(int)Player.Stat("virusStrengthBonus"),UtilitySlots=d.VirusSlots,Nodes=nodes};ConfigureHackN(t,UtilityHackState);Say("Intrusion link established. Reveal adjacent nodes; destroy the system core.");}
 public bool ClickUtilityHack(int index){var h=UtilityHackState;if(h==null||h.Complete||index<0||index>=49)return false;var target=Targets.FirstOrDefault(t=>t.Id==h.Target&&t.Alive);var state=Player.Utilities[h.Slot];if(target==null||!state.Active||LockedId!=h.Target||Vector3.Distance(Player.Position,target.Position)>UtilityRange(state.Definition!)){FailUtilityHack();return false;}var n=h.Nodes[index];if(n.Cleared)return false;if(h.HexN&&n.Open&&n.Kind=="Cache"){if(h.Tools.Count>=h.UtilitySlots)return false;h.Tools.Add(n.Tool.Length>0?n.Tool:"Repair");n.Cleared=true;HackTurnN(h);return true;}if(!n.Open){int x=index%7,y=index/7;bool frontier=Enumerable.Range(0,49).Any(j=>h.Nodes[j].Cleared&&Math.Abs(j%7-x)+Math.Abs(j/7-y)==1);if(h.HexN)frontier=HackFrontierN(h,index);if(!frontier)return false;n.Open=true;if(h.HexN&&n.Kind=="DataCache"){ResolveDataCacheN(h,n);HackTurnN(h);return true;}if(n.Kind=="Empty"){n.Cleared=true;HackTurnN(h);return true;}if(n.Kind=="Cache"){if(h.HexN&&h.Tools.Count>=h.UtilitySlots){HackTurnN(h);return true;}if(h.Tools.Count<h.UtilitySlots)h.Tools.Add(n.Tool.Length>0?n.Tool:new[]{"Repair","Rot","Shield","Vector"}[_rng.Next(4)]);n.Cleared=true;HackTurnN(h);return true;}HackTurnN(h);return true;}
 int suppressors=h.Nodes.Count(n=>n.Open&&!n.Cleared&&n.Kind=="Suppressor");n.Hp-=Math.Max(1,h.Strength-suppressors*4);if(n.Hp<=0){n.Cleared=true;if(n.Kind=="Core"){h.Complete=h.Won=true;RecordTaskM("Hack");target.Hacked=true;if(target.Id=="vault"||Grid=="signal")SignalHacked=true;var site=UtilitySites.FirstOrDefault(s=>s.Id==target.Id);if(site!=null)site.Completed=true;StopUtility(state);if(ActiveEncounterF is {} e)EvaluateEncounterF(e);SyncEncounterF();Say("Archive unlocked. Loot within 2.5 km.");}HackTurnN(h);return true;}int damage=n.Strength;if(h.HexN&&h.ShieldTurnsN>0){damage=0;h.ShieldTurnsN--;}if(h.Shield>0){damage=Math.Max(0,damage-h.Shield);h.Shield=0;}h.Coherence-=damage;if(!h.HexN)foreach(var repair in h.Nodes.Where(n=>n.Open&&!n.Cleared&&n.Kind=="Restoration"))n.Hp+=4;HackTurnN(h);if(h.Coherence<=0)FailUtilityHack();return true;}
 public bool UseUtilityHackTool(int slot,int node){var h=UtilityHackState;if(h==null||h.Complete||slot<0||slot>=h.Tools.Count||node<0||node>=49)return false;if(h.HexN)return UseHackToolN(h,slot,node);string tool=h.Tools[slot];var n=h.Nodes[node];if(tool is "Rot" or "Vector"&&(!n.Open||n.Cleared))return false;h.Tools.RemoveAt(slot);if(tool=="Repair")h.Coherence=Math.Min(h.MaxCoherence,h.Coherence+18);if(tool=="Shield")h.Shield=20;if(tool=="Rot")n.Hp=Math.Max(1,n.Hp/2);if(tool=="Vector")n.Hp=Math.Max(1,n.Hp-25);return true;}
 public void FailUtilityHack(){var h=UtilityHackState;if(h==null||h.Complete)return;h.Complete=true;h.Won=false;var t=Targets.FirstOrDefault(t=>t.Id==h.Target);if(t!=null){t.HackAttempts++;t.Destroyed=t.HackAttempts>=2;var site=UtilitySites.FirstOrDefault(s=>s.Id==t.Id);if(site!=null)site.Attempts=t.HackAttempts;}if(t!=null)FailHackSiteN(t);if(h.Slot>=0&&h.Slot<16)StopUtility(Player.Utilities[h.Slot]);if(ActiveEncounterF is {} e)EvaluateEncounterF(e);SyncEncounterF();Say(ActiveEncounterF?.ProfileN?.Family=="Ghost"?"Intrusion failed. Research container detonated.":"Intrusion failed. Two failed attempts destroy the container.");}
}
